"""Weekly Picks tab - lightweight module for dashboard integration.

This mirrors the monthly picks tab but targets `models/weekly_run/` and a
separate naming convention. It is intentionally small to keep import cheap.

Exports:
- layout()
- register_callbacks(app, SH=None)

Features:
- Discover latest weekly picks CSV under models/weekly_run/
- Prepare a display DataFrame with Rank, Date, Ticker, Price (live), Profit/Loss
- Small metrics row (Overall spend, Total P/L, ROI)
- Simple Run button that starts a local background job placeholder
"""

